# SHA-256 checksums for the mediamtx-rpicamera tarballs, pinned to the
# version in Makefile's MTXRPICAM_VERSION. Each line maps a tarball name to
# the SHA-256 of its .tar.gz blob — same unit the upstream verifier uses
# (mediamtx's internal/staticsources/rpicamera/mtxrpicamdownloader/HASH_*).
#
# Bumping the version requires updating this file in lockstep:
#   1. update MTXRPICAM_VERSION in Makefile and .goreleaser.yml
#   2. cross-check the new hashes against
#        - the mediamtx-rpicamera release's checksums.sha256
#        - mediamtx's own HASH_MTXRPICAM_*_TAR_GZ at the matching release
#      so the two independent sources agree before recording them here
#   3. commit Makefile + .goreleaser.yml + this file together
#
# Pinned to mediamtx-rpicamera v2.4.3 (matches mediamtx v1.13.1).
db9310fe114fa09d8427e93331fe6aec9ff3ba4aa486c7e7edbcbab9eae043cf  mtxrpicam_32.tar.gz
f6073cad9fd6c8570141f08aed72237ec062d28883b8ab62a37dbce190409f0d  mtxrpicam_64.tar.gz
